TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution using built-in Calcite rate, 100 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0  0
        -steps 10 100*10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
END
